ijgen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/the-read-down/gabriel-garcia-marquez-books/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-06-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/76260/liefde-in-tijden-van-cholera.html","sha256":"ff83b9b1925b8121c842925e841097b9559de8e31fc84b7b503c901a0de160e6","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:01:53.082Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789029090483 verschijningsdatum 07/10/2014 NUR 300 Literaire fictie algemeen 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle uitgever Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Gabriel Garcia Marquez","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/the-read-down/gabriel-garcia-marquez-books/","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Work-bound content independently read; original factual summary, not source quotation."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789041411426","key":{"id":977200138},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100051,"title":"Noem me bij jouw naam","language":"nld","isbn_13":"9789041411426","isbn_10":null,"open_library_edition_id":null,"publisher":"Ambo/Anthos B.V.","id":977200138}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789041411426","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789041411426"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789041411426","work_id":977100051,"bound_author_id":977300025,"bound_title":"Noem me bij jouw naam","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789041411426","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000093003_Noem_me_bij_jouw_naam_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/401395/noem-me-bij-jouw-naam.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-06-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/401395/noem-me-bij-jouw-naam.html","sha256":"3768c747620beefc6c709598213ca35bc82e61a5049aa24205c70161a534ceac","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:02:39.823Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789041411426 verschijningsdatum 02/08/2007 NUR 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle imprint Anthos uitgever Ambo/Anthos B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Andre Aciman","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000093003_Noem_me_bij_jouw_naam_0_0.jpg","sha256":"64622b9578d021d31accf1b7cc603c72b4425d0d85ab0d02b05e0a9e622711fa","bytes":32184,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:20:28.436Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet5"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:75","key":{"work_id":977100051,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100051,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":977300025,"text":"Elio verblijft met zijn ouders aan de Italiaanse kust wanneer de Amerikaanse intellectueel Oliver als zomergast bij hen intrekt. Tussen de muzikale jongen en de bezoeker ontstaat een aantrekkingskracht die zij aanvankelijk achter onverschilligheid verbergen. Hun toenadering verloopt via voorzichtig aftasten en onzekerheid over elkaars bedoelingen. De roman volgt hoe een intense ontmoeting hun zelfbeeld en gevoelens verandert en een betekenis krijgt die verder reikt dan het gezamenlijke verblijf.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/401395/noem-me-bij-jouw-naam.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-06-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/401395/noem-me-bij-jouw-naam.html","sha256":"3768c747620beefc6c7095982