"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789046822982","key":{"id":977200142},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100055,"title":"Het onsterfelijke leven van Henrietta Lacks","language":"nld","isbn_13":"9789046822982","isbn_10":null,"open_library_edition_id":null,"publisher":"Park Uitgevers","id":977200142}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789046822982","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789046822982"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789046822982","work_id":977100055,"bound_author_id":977300029,"bound_title":"Het onsterfelijke leven van Henrietta Lacks","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789046822982","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000387111_Het_onsterfelijke_leven_van_Henrietta_Lacks_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/994300/het-onsterfelijke-leven-van-henrietta-lacks.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-06-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/994300/het-onsterfelijke-leven-van-henrietta-lacks.html","sha256":"ead2a43099f0f92141203eec4b21420ad40df7859dc5fa53d2d21d94ae64ee1f","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:02:48.479Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789046822982 verschijningsdatum 23/10/2017 NUR 686 Moderne geschiedenis (1870-heden) imprint Nieuw Amsterdam uitgever Park Uitgevers taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Rebecca Skloot","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000387111_Het_onsterfelijke_leven_van_Henrietta_Lacks_0_0.jpg","sha256":"4e9af44ca8e480f84d00daaf33f9d70432a1a695d4b799162e723a1261babc9f","bytes":92990,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:20:33.570Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet5"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:80","key":{"work_id":977100055,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100055,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":977300029,"text":"Cellen die zonder Henrietta Lacks'' medeweten werden afgenomen, groeiden uit tot de bekende HeLa-cellijn en speelden een grote rol in medisch onderzoek. Haar eigen leven en de ervaringen van haar familie bleven veel minder bekend. Rebecca Skloot brengt beide geschiedenissen samen. Het boek onderzoekt hoe wetenschappelijke vooruitgang, commerciële belangen en vragen over zeggenschap met elkaar botsen wanneer menselijk lichaamsmateriaal een zelfstandig bestaan in laboratoria krijgt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/994300/het-onsterfelijke-leven-van-henrietta-lacks.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-06-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/994300/het-onsterfelijke-leven-van-henrietta-lacks.html","sha256":"ead2a43099f0f92141203eec4b21420ad40df7859dc5fa53d2d21d94ae64ee1f","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:02:48.479Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789046822982 verschijningsdatum 23/10/2017 NUR 686 Moderne geschiedenis (1870-heden) imprint Nieuw Amsterdam uitgever Park Uitgevers taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Rebecca Skloot","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789047009009","key":{"id":977200143},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100056,"title":"Ons feilbare denken","language":"nld","isbn_13":"9789047009009","isbn_10":null,"open_library_edition_id":null,"publisher":"Atlas Contact, Uitgeverij","id":977200143}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789047009009","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789047009009"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789047009009","work_id":977100056,"bound_author_id":977300030,"bound_title":"Ons feilbare denken","bou